x recorded paths. Both generator drift checks pass. The focused help and CLI reference suite passes with 34 tests. Lint and type checking pass. Git whitespace validation passes. Manual documentation review confirms the guidance matches ADR 0039 and the current importer. The diff contains no importer runtime path. The full test suite was omitted under the operator direction for documentation-only changes.","timestamp":1787479211879202001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F10 was committed as 7e3d9d0b12 and pushed to Gerrit change 2156. The commit carries the canonical ticket trailer, DCO sign-off, and Change-Id. Local precommit lint and type checking passed. Gerrit gate monitoring is active.","timestamp":1787479367631231001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F10 landed on origin/main as 7e3d9d0b12 through Gerrit change 2156. LLM-Review and Verified both passed, and no unresolved comments remained before submission.\n\nCI_RESULT\nrun_id: 32632666461\nstatus: passed\nduration_seconds: 1576\nfixes_applied: []\nretry_count: 0","timestamp":1787481414415361001}],"created_at":1787417220697877001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"fff58414-74b5-4c7e-b3c8-2ad821dc6234","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"38b0-1cec-0869-421a"}],"description":"## Context\nImport help still describes duplicate creation and future batching. ADR 0039 and `cold-stall-chalk` delivered an import-only batching carveout, deferred push, and source-based resumption. The current implementation does not provide whole-file atomicity or automatic repair for every partial import.\n\n## Plan\n- Update canonical import parser help before generated artifacts.\n- Document 256-event chunks for independent create, parent, file-impact or verify-command, and comment passes.\n- State that link and status passes remain per-event.\n- Document deferred push after successful import work.\n- Document serial `source_id` skipping, incomplete-ticket risk after a crash between passes, and concurrent duplicate risk when scans race.\n- Regenerate packaged import help, overview help, and the CLI reference.\n- Correct `docs/import-export.md` without changing importer behavior.\n- Add focused behavioral assertions for generated help and recovery guidance.\n\n## Testing\n- Run `python scripts/gen_cli_help.py --check` to verify packaged and overview help are regenerated from canonical parser help.\n- Run `python scripts/gen_cli_reference.py --check` to verify the external CLI reference is regenerated from canonical parser help.\n- Run `python -m pytest tests/unit/test_gen_cli_help.py tests/unit/test_gen_cli_reference.py -q` for the focused help-generator and import-documentation contracts.\n- Run `make lint` and `make typecheck` for source checks.\n- Inspect the final diff to confirm that no importer runtime module changed.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Canonical import help describes current batching behavior.\n- [x] Canonical import help describes deferred-push behavior.\n- [x] `python scripts/gen_cli_help.py --check` confirms packaged help matches the canonical source.\n- [x] `python scripts/gen_cli_reference.py --check` confirms the CLI reference matches the canonical source.\n- [x] Overview help carries the canonical import summary.\n- [x] User guidance describes partial results.\n- [x] User guidance describes supported serial rerun behavior.\n- [x] Guidance promises no whole-file atomicity.\n- [x] Guidance promises no automatic completion of partial tickets.\n- [x] Concurrent-import limitations are explicit.\n- [x] Focused help-generator assertions pass under `python -m pytest tests/unit/test_gen_cli_help.py tests/unit/test_gen_cli_reference.py -q`.\n- [x] Focused import-documentation assertions pass under `python -m pytest tests/unit/test_gen_cli_help.py tests/unit/test_gen_cli_reference.py -q`.\n- [x] The final diff contains no importer runtime changes.\n- [x] Import runtime behavior is unchanged.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/core/io.py","reason":"Correct canonical import help."},{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/help/import.txt","reason":"Regenerate packaged import help."},{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/help/overview.txt","reason":"Regenerate the overview summary from canonical import help."},{"path":"docs/cli-reference.md","reason":"Regenerate the external CLI reference."},{"path":"docs/import-export.md","reason":"Document batching, partial results, and recovery."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_gen_cli_help.py","reason":"Pin current import help and recovery guidance through focused assertions."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["parent","f7e4-4d33-f231-4774"],["relates_to","38b0-1cec-0869-421a"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"f7e4-4d33-f231-4774","parent_status_uuid":"d61c0250-b85d-4ff9-8ff9-f9c742a5fe8e","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["documentation","f10","import"],"ticket_id":"c679-d455-550e-4c02","ticket_type":"story","title":"F10 document import batching and partial recovery","verify_commands":[{"command":"python scripts/gen_cli_help.py --check","dd_id":"D1","dd_text":"Packaged CLI help is current"},{"command":"python scripts/gen_cli_reference.py --check","dd_id":"D2","dd_text":"Generated CLI reference is current"},{"command":"python -m pytest tests/unit/test_gen_cli_help.py tests/unit/test_gen_cli_reference.py -q","dd_id":"D3","dd_text":"Focused help generator contracts pass"},{"command":"make lint && make typecheck","dd_id":"D4","dd_text":"Source checks pass"}]},"source_event_uuids":["1ca18773-17d4-4857-b0b5-0858988ffa90","a16d0c44-d2b0-41ef-ade9-172c13dcdba7","d61c0250-b85d-4ff9-8ff9-f9c742a5fe8e","319aabeb-8de5-4